{%- comment -%}
  custom-collections — the three category panels: engagement, wedding,
  eternity. One tall panel left, two stacked right.

  1 use: index. It is the main route off the homepage into the three ranges, so
  it is worth its own section rather than a generic image-grid.

  Setting IDs frozen, awkward names and all: `left_*`, `top_*`, `bottom_*`
  (image / heading / btn / link). "Top" and "bottom" describe the right-hand
  column, which reads oddly, but 1 template's content depends on those exact
  keys and renaming would mean re-entering it.

  WHAT CHANGED FROM THE OLD THEME
  - Headings were UPPERCASE strings typed into the setting. They still render
    uppercase, but from CSS, so the setting can hold sentence case and the
    casing stays consistent if the brand ever changes it.
  - Text sits on the brand's low-opacity teal scrim (`.scrim` in core), not on
    the raw photograph. Ivory type straight onto a light ring photo was the
    contrast problem here.
  - The `custom_css` block that came with this section on the live template is
    not carried over; there was nothing in it.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign s = section.settings
  assign ground = s.ground | default: 'white'
-%}

<section class="ccols band band--{{ ground }}" data-screen-label="Category panels">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="ccols__grid">

      {%- comment -%}
        Three near-identical panels. Written out rather than looped: the setting
        IDs are three unrelated prefixes, and a loop over ['left','top','bottom']
        with string-built keys is exactly the kind of cleverness that makes the
        next edit hard to follow.
      {%- endcomment -%}

      {%- if s.left_heading != blank or s.left_image != blank -%}
        <a class="ccols__panel ccols__panel--lead scrim" href="{{ s.left_link | default: '#' }}">
          {%- if s.left_image != blank -%}
            {{ s.left_image | image_url: width: 1200 | image_tag:
               loading: 'lazy', widths: '500,800,1000,1200',
               sizes: '(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 50vw',
               alt: s.left_image.alt | escape, class: 'ccols__img' }}
          {%- endif -%}
          <span class="ccols__words">
            {%- if s.left_heading != blank -%}
              <span class="ccols__heading">{{ s.left_heading }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if s.left_btn != blank -%}
              <span class="link ccols__link">{{ s.left_btn }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </span>
        </a>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if s.top_heading != blank or s.top_image != blank -%}
        <a class="ccols__panel scrim" href="{{ s.top_link | default: '#' }}">
          {%- if s.top_image != blank -%}
            {{ s.top_image | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag:
               loading: 'lazy', widths: '400,600,900',
               sizes: '(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 25vw',
               alt: s.top_image.alt | escape, class: 'ccols__img' }}
          {%- endif -%}
          <span class="ccols__words">
            {%- if s.top_heading != blank -%}
              <span class="ccols__heading">{{ s.top_heading }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if s.top_btn != blank -%}
              <span class="link ccols__link">{{ s.top_btn }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </span>
        </a>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if s.bottom_heading != blank or s.bottom_image != blank -%}
        <a class="ccols__panel scrim" href="{{ s.bottom_link | default: '#' }}">
          {%- if s.bottom_image != blank -%}
            {{ s.bottom_image | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag:
               loading: 'lazy', widths: '400,600,900',
               sizes: '(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 25vw',
               alt: s.bottom_image.alt | escape, class: 'ccols__img' }}
          {%- endif -%}
          <span class="ccols__words">
            {%- if s.bottom_heading != blank -%}
              <span class="ccols__heading">{{ s.bottom_heading }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if s.bottom_btn != blank -%}
              <span class="link ccols__link">{{ s.bottom_btn }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </span>
        </a>
      {%- endif -%}

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% stylesheet %}
.fye .ccols__grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: var(--grid-gap);
}
.fye .ccols__panel--lead { grid-row: span 2; }

.fye .ccols__panel {
  position: relative;
  display: block;
  overflow: hidden;
  min-height: 260px;
  color: var(--on-dark);
}
.fye .ccols__img {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
  transition: transform var(--dur) var(--ease);
}
.fye .ccols__panel:hover .ccols__img { transform: scale(1.03); }

/* .scrim in core lays the low-opacity teal over the photo and lifts direct
   children above it — hence the words being a child, not a sibling. */
.fye .ccols__words {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: var(--s4);
  height: 100%;
  padding: var(--s7);
  text-align: center;
}
.fye .ccols__heading {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: var(--fs-h3);
  letter-spacing: var(--tr-h2);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--on-dark);
}
.fye .ccols__panel--lead .ccols__heading { font-size: var(--fs-h2); }
.fye .ccols__link { color: var(--on-dark); }
.fye .ccols__panel:hover .ccols__link { color: var(--sage-grey); }

.fye .ccols__panel--lead { min-height: 540px; }

@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .fye .ccols__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; grid-template-rows: none; }
  .fye .ccols__panel--lead { grid-row: auto; min-height: 320px; }
  .fye .ccols__panel { min-height: 240px; }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .fye .ccols__panel:hover .ccols__img { transform: none; }
}
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Category panels",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "header", "content": "Large panel" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "left_image", "label": "Image" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "left_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Engagement rings" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "left_btn", "label": "Link text", "default": "View our rings" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "left_link", "label": "Link" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Upper small panel" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "top_image", "label": "Image" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "top_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Wedding rings" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "top_btn", "label": "Link text", "default": "View our rings" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "top_link", "label": "Link" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Lower small panel" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "bottom_image", "label": "Image" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "bottom_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Eternity rings" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "bottom_btn", "label": "Link text", "default": "View our rings" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "bottom_link", "label": "Link" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Background" },
    {
      "type": "select", "id": "ground", "label": "Background", "default": "white",
      "options": [
        { "value": "white", "label": "White" },
        { "value": "ivory", "label": "Ivory" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Category panels" }]
}
{% endschema %}
